;Smaragd Dash: a cave of the game (tools/mkcave.py)
;The amoeba spreads from the corner. Collect before it covers the
;field - at 200 cells it turns to boulders. Between it and the field
;stand expanding walls that grow every way: what Rockford digs out
;beside them becomes wall, and the amoeba cannot eat wall.
